1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,015
Raise just one

2
00:00:01,015 --> 00:00:02,700
of your eyebrows.

3
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:03,697
Both went up,

4
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:04,400
right?

5
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,270
Relax,

6
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:06,310
your eyebrows are on

7
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,800
one puppet string.

8
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,041
Each half of your brain

9
00:00:09,041 --> 00:00:10,479
holds a string...

10
00:00:10,479 --> 00:00:13,420
tied to BOTH brows.

11
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,710
Now try half a smile.

12
00:00:15,710 --> 00:00:16,840
Easy, right?

13
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:17,561
Your mouth gets

14
00:00:17,561 --> 00:00:19,567
one string per side.

15
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,260
That's why,

16
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,470
after a stroke,

17
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,207
doctors check the forehead:

18
00:00:23,207 --> 00:00:24,610
it usually still lifts

19
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,280
on both sides.

20
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,280
Still can't?

21
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,780
Hold one down.

22
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:30,352
Nobody has to know.

